.TH HOODMIN-DB-SETUP 8 "2026-10-18" "Hoodmin 0.1.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
hoodmin-db-setup \- initialize or upgrade the Hoodmin database
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hoodmin-db-setup
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run as root after PostgreSQL is running. Applies packaged migrations using checksums, an advisory lock and a transaction for each migration. Refuses an untracked legacy schema. Make a backup before upgrading.
.SH SEE ALSO
/usr/share/doc/hoodmin/docs/uretim-kurulumu.md
